<title>USA: HCC to buy occupational accident business.</title>
<headline>HCC to buy occupational accident business.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HCC Insurance Holdings Inc said Monday that it agreed to acquire all of the occupational accident business of TRM International Inc 's group of companies in exchange for stock and cash.</p>
<p>Under the deal, it will acquire the business in exchange for 266,667 shares of its stock and $6.55 million in cash.</p>
<p>The deal is to be effective as of December 1.</p>
<p>HCC Insurance is an international specialty insurance group.</p>
</text>
